abstract: >-
  rotcert implements angle-aware conformal certification for oriented (rotated)
  object detection: a seam-continuous, square-safe Gaussian Wasserstein
  nonconformity score, source-uniform hierarchical calibration for matched
  objects, free-dimension center and orientation projections of the certified
  set, and recall certificates with explicit finite-reporting rules. Version
  0.3.0 adds the analysis code of the revised article, evaluated on DIOR-R,
  DOTA-v1.0, HRSID, DroneVehicle and CODrone.
